; FIFO booking + cost-basis gain inference parity (#238 + #242).
;
; Two augmenting buys at different cost bases, then a `{}` reduction
; whose lot key is filled in by FIFO matching: oldest lot first. The
; reducing posting is split into one synthesised posting per matched
; lot, and the null `Income:Trading` posting fills against the
; cost-basis residual (not @price-derived cash) to record the
; realized capital gain. doppio's Beancount frontend and bean-check
; should produce identical per-(account, commodity, lot) inventories
; AND identical Income:Trading totals after elaboration.

option "operating_currency" "USD"

2024-01-01 open Assets:Brokerage GOLD "FIFO"
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2024-01-01 open Income:Trading

2024-01-15 * "Buy first lot"
  Assets:Brokerage   10 GOLD {1500.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash       -15000.00 USD

2024-02-15 * "Buy second lot"
  Assets:Brokerage   10 GOLD {1600.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash       -16000.00 USD

2024-03-15 * "Sell across two lots, FIFO"
  Assets:Brokerage   -15 GOLD {} @ 1700.00 USD
  Assets:Cash       25500.00 USD
  Income:Trading
